==German==
===Etymology===
From Austrian {{term|Dechtlmechtl|lang=de}}. The word probably derives from the {{etyl|yi|de}} rhyme word {{term|||tr=tacht(i)|secret|lang=yi}}, which is repeated in slightly different ways.

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n|Techtelmechtels|Techtelmechtel}}
# a [[hanky-panky]] (love affair)
